    Welcome to the PLACE (tm) Development Software from ICT!

PLACE (PEEL Logic Architectural Compiler and Editor) is an advanced
development software product for ICT's family of PEEL (Programmable
Electrically Erasable Logic) Arrays and Devices.

PLACE features include:
      (1) an architectural editor,
      (2) a logic compiler with logic reduction and minimization,
      (3) a waveform display logic editor and simulator,
      (4) a documentation operation, and
      (5) a programmer interface.

The PLACE On-Line Help facility allows quick references for all
functions and operations. Press the <F1> key for the general Help
instructions. If you are not already familiar with the features of
the PEEL Arrays and Devices, please refer to the ICT Data Book.